   "tag": "a.mobile-link",
   "text": "About"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p.font-mono.text-accent",
   "text": "// AI EXPLORATIONS"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h1.text-7xl.font-bold",
   "text": "AI Experiments & Research"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p.text-gray-400.font-mono",
   "text": "An active exploration into machine learning models, ControlNet spatial rendering, and custom generative visual systems integrated into design production workflows."
  },
  {
   "tag": "span.font-mono.text-accent",
   "text": "// FOUNDATION_ETHOS"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h2.text-3xl.font-bold",
   "text": "Ethos: Artificial Acceptance"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p.text-gray-400.font-mono",
   "text": "AI should be treated as a collaborator to enhance and improve elements of the design process from concepting ideas to refining outcomes. AI should not be treated as a competitor within the design industry. There are clear pitfalls in the ethics and regulations behind generative models being trained on artwork which has not been consented to by human artists. I have been experimenting with use cases of AI in design projects since 2022. The rate at which AI technology and tools are developing is crazy. I have used many different applications of AI throughout these projects and experiments: everything from direct video and image generation, using ControlNet to create interesting outcomes, and AI-assisted web design. I am optimistic that the truly innovative AI applications will benefit the industry."
  },
  {
   "tag": "span.font-mono.text-accent",
   "text": "// DEPLOYED_PLATFORMS_&_MODELS"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h2.text-3xl.font-bold",
   "text": "Platform & Model Directory"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span.hud-spec-label",
   "text": "ACTIVE_PLATFORM_SPEC"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span.font-mono.text-accent",
   "text": "[ MIDJOURNEY INC. ]"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h4.text-xl.font-bold",
   "text": "Midjourney"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p.hud-spec-val",
   "text": "Generating high-quality concept art, storyboards for videos and detailed textures for design projects."
  },
  {
   "tag": "span.font-mono.text-accent",
   "text": "// WORK_&_EXPERIMENT_INDEX"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h2.comfy-section-title.mt-2",
   "text": "AI Projects & Case Studies"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span.ai-tag",
   "text": "Midjourney"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h3.ai-card-title",
   "text": "Monolith Survival"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p.ai-card-desc",
   "text": "A mock outdoor apparel campaign built entirely through AI. Exploring gorpcore aesthetics and how convincing a brand film could look using only generated footage."
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "text": "View Project"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span.ai-tag",
   "text": "Midjourney"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h3.ai-card-title",
   "text": "Dredge"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p.ai-card-desc",
   "text": "The same concept as Monolith but for deep-sea fishing fashion. A mock campaign exploring heavy-duty oceanic workwear against bioluminescent underwater backdrops."
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "text": "View Project"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span.ai-tag",
   "text": "HiDream"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span.ai-tag",
   "text": "ComfyUI"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h3.ai-card-title",
   "text": "Synthetic Corals"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p.ai-card-desc",
   "text": "Generating imaginary coral reef structures using a custom ComfyUI workflow. Each run produced wildly different results, from bleached calcification to glowing bioluminescent forms."
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "text": "View Project"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span.ai-tag",
   "text": "AntiGravity"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h3.ai-card-title",
   "text": "willvernon.online Rebuild"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p.ai-card-desc",
   "text": "This portfolio site was rebuilt from scratch by pair-programming with Antigravity AI. A real test of how far designer-AI collaboration can go on a live project."
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "text": "View Project"
  }
